Do NOT invent four new lessons.

Do NOT keep 34 lessons active.

Check EVERY supported learning stage.

The final active structure must be:

Stage/Grade A → exactly 30 lessons
Stage/Grade B → exactly 30 lessons
Stage/Grade C → exactly 30 lessons
etc.

Use the actual lesson content found in the repository.

If genuine content is missing from the repository, do not fabricate it. Report exactly what is missing.

